              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yenowu iyala wakama nindiwakenki tata yanowu chapadima makumi asiliva atanu, hakekalaŋa Iŋodindi, muloŋa namusawishi dehi; kutwesha kumuseŋa nehi nyaka yindi yejima.",
          "type": "text",
